# Hero, rat, goblin. Three 18x18 frames, drawn 1:1.
#
# The hero is the only figure painted in crypt-* — the same greys as the
# architecture — and the monsters are the only things painted in bile-*. That
# inversion is deliberate: the player's eye locks onto the hue it has never
# seen in a wall, so a moving thing separates from a static thing before either
# is identified.
#
# blood-mark is two pixels of eye per monster and nothing else in the game.
name roguelike-actors
size 54 18
key o outline
key T crypt-3
key F crypt-5-hilite
key H crypt-4
key G bile-2
key g bile-1
key R blood-mark
pixels
